# PC card pc-melee-states (BENCH-232): master on today's whole melee field with the melee trace on, 46 fields x 1 seed (3330), 20 rounds, no baseline: the card reads the traces, it compares no builds. Template: msprep writes work/melee-states.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml and @C@ = the host's melee width.
